Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[OHM]\NQuite the gathering.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How many players remain\Nin our little game?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.01,0:02:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We have four\NDivine Squad members.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.39,0:02:08.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And since I doubt the wounds\NI dealt those two were fatal,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}that leaves us with\Nfour Shandorians
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.15,0:02:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and one Blue Sea dweller.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.69,0:02:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Counting the Lord\Nof the Sky and Holy,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}that's ten people\Nand two animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just as God Eneru predicted.\NSo, there we stand.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.91,0:02:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...for harming Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.42,0:02:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is that so?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.83,0:02:25.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You'd willingly forfeit\Nyour life for this sad speck?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mind who you throw\Nyour loyalty to, savage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You cannot run!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.00,0:02:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Enough of this... Holy,\Nit's time for your Mad Dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps, screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Finish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.19,0:03:18.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's building some\Nkind of fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's using more of his tricks.\NThis could be trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[grunts]\NNo tricks here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.71,0:03:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Behold, the Ordeal of Iron!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.84,0:03:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[DIVINE SQUAD A]\NThe White\NBarbed Death Match has begun!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.04,0:03:36.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, you can put up a fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:40.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big deal. I wasn't\Nplanning to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[bleats]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.25,0:03:44.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The purpose of this barrier\Nisn't just to hold you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's a reason\Nit's called White Barbs.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NShow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess the thorns are painful.\NThanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.07,0:04:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So how do I get outta here\Nonce I'm done with all'a you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.97,0:04:08.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can worry about that later,\Nassuming you survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NOnly eight people\Nand two animals left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NWyper...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.44,0:04:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NWyper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper! Listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.69,0:04:31.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quickly! There isn't much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.19,0:04:39.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had to come to give you\NKamakiri's warning!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.74,0:04:42.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody can beat... Eneru...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Abandon this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:58.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru. He's in the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru is lightning itself. He\Ntruly has the powers of a God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave! At once!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He cannot be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NDo as I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I hear my name?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.21,0:05:29.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave her be!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.13,0:05:33.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki's not here to fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you want!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki! Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.84,0:05:41.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd forget about her and\Nworry more about myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:42.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:55.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NLaki... Hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and rightly so.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE SQUAD A grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.05,0:06:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've sealed your fate, Wyper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:41.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.09,0:06:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growling]\NEneru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? You should be\Nwrithing in pure agony.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.52,0:06:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:54.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts, groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.65,0:07:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't actually\Nthink I'd spare her?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.78,0:07:05.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper, the "ruthless\NShandorian warrior."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.78,0:07:08.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surely you understand\Nthe concept of "no mercy"?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.66,0:07:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She opposed me,\Nand now she's dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.12,0:07:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll join her soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:23.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.27,0:07:31.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE SQUAD C grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN B yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's him?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's God?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weep not for her.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that all God's children\Npray for. She is free.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.51,0:07:44.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since we're all\Ngettin' personal,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.01,0:07:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's a score I\Nhave to settle as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.68,0:07:49.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WYPER, ZORO]\N– The snake!\N– The snake!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to cough up\Nwhat's in your belly!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growls]\NGet out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:56.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO, WYPER grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:08:00.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Holy! They need a hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOLY roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.29,0:08:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[OHM]\NEisen Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Axe Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:12.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The numbers dwindle.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.85,0:08:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Six people and\Ntwo animals remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:34.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:39.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By the looks of it, I'd say\Nshe wasn't seriously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.34,0:08:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where in the world\Nis this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.39,0:08:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got swallowed up, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.85,0:08:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.77,0:08:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The beast seems even\Nlarger from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.52,0:08:53.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAisa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.11,0:08:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:04.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA]\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.67,0:09:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NRight, for the umpteenth time...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.81,0:09:09.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been eaten by a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A snake?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.86,0:09:13.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCalm down. We'll survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can escape\Nbefore it digests us.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What were you two\Ndoing out there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.63,0:09:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.59,0:09:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell that to the creeps\Nwho were chasing us.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We had to run for lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that little\Ngirl a Shandorian?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:30.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall, it's you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.41,0:09:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]\NI'll mash\Nyou into pieces!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.99,0:09:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.49,0:09:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why don't we\Nsimply carve our way out?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.83,0:09:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you insane, old man?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suppose the snake\Nstarts going wild!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.71,0:09:44.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get us all killed!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya know, for a knight,\Nyou're pretty dense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I, uh, was kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.16,0:09:49.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take a look around you!\NWe are in a stomach!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A snake's stomach!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much\Nyou know about anatomy,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it won't be long\Nbefore we're bathing
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in its metabolic acid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cries]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:04.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Weird knight guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.69,0:10:06.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.03,0:10:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI was starting to think\NI was the only one here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.57,0:10:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the strangest cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE chirps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. That's an understatement.\NHow'd you end up here?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just got stuck here\Nand I can't get out.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This snake's turning out\Nto be a serious problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.94,0:10:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! A snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.80,0:10:29.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who'd you think this\Nstomach belonged to?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.68,0:10:33.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... How could you\Nbe here talking to me
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you were swallowed\Nby a giant snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I said!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big, blue reptile\Nwith mile-long fangs!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.77,0:10:43.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It ate us and now we're\Nstuck in its belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow, come on, Nami. That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! Hi, I'm Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he a... jester?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That job would suit him best
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but he's actually Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.94,0:11:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's your captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.32,0:11:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My word.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this world coming to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure are calm for someone\Nwho's been eaten by a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:11.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! I thought that\NNami was only joking!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.10,0:11:16.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean we're being\Neaten by a snake?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.14,0:11:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to tell you...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.14,0:11:20.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its stomach acid is\Nmelting your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, what're we waitin' for?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.68,0:11:27.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to find its\Nbutthole right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.73,0:11:31.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're despicable!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why? Maybe we can get out
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,next time the snake\Ngoes to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:39.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! I'd rather get digested!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean, child.\NShe's meaner than the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.19,0:11:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hardly. When the snake\Ngets in a bad mood
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it starts eating people.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And speaking of which,\Nwe'd better think fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.11,0:11:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its temper was wild enough\Non the outside, and be...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWait, the snake was\Nin a "bad mood"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:01.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.63,0:12:04.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy. What have\Nyou been doing in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. I was tryin' to\Nbust through a wall.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.71,0:12:07.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't work, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.01,0:12:12.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, so this is all your doing.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Throwing all those punches\Nburned up a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.60,0:12:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, um... Did any of you\Nthink to bring some food?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.98,0:12:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How about you eat my fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:32.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:50.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.40,0:13:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter,\Ngotta belly ache?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It serves ya right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAKE growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:13.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NIt won't be long, Aisa! Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NOpen up, serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:42.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis is getting really old.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.13,0:13:46.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That extendable sword\Nhe's using is a pain.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.42,0:13:47.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that snake...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I already know defeating him\Nfirst isn't exactly gonna be
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.76,0:13:50.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I have to get Nami\Nand the old Knight
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.46,0:13:54.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,out of that thing's\Ngut right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's still time. Since\Nthey were swallowed whole,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would bet they're\Nnot dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:13:59.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAKE roaring]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NBut it won't be\Nthat way for long.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.54,0:14:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[OHM]\NEisen Whip!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.41,0:14:06.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:23.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[OHM]\NEisen Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make that four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN A groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NTwo Swords Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hawk Wave!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.25,0:15:19.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eisen Back Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.65,0:15:23.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAn iron wall...?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NThis sword is an iron cloud.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.33,0:15:34.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NYou didn't think clouds\Nhad a set shape did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.34,0:15:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eisen Fan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eisen Fork!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:42.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eisen Rapier! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:46.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.09,0:15:53.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHe's predicting my movements.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.63,0:15:55.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why can't I avoid it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.93,0:15:57.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.39,0:15:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keeping your distance\Ndoesn't do you any good
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you depend on your sword.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou're wrong about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Thirty-six Caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Eisen Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:19.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHow could he block it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.12,0:16:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:34.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.13,0:16:38.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NThat's quite an\Ninteresting technique
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you've developed,\NBlue Sea Dweller.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NI wonder if\Nyou'll try that again.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.56,0:16:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, even if\Nyou lose sight of me,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.27,0:16:54.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll always know\Nwhere you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.75,0:16:59.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...by using Mantora.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.20,0:17:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NLooks like we just\Nlost another one.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.74,0:17:16.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now there are two animals\Nand three people left.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NBut soon there\Nwill be two animals
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.64,0:17:25.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and only two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAKE roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NSo you're the leader of\Nthe Blue Sea People up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.32,0:17:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and your comrades\Nall put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.03,0:17:42.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, my sword is now\Npointed directly at your heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.93,0:17:46.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NSay your prayers, swordsman!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDon't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.77,0:17:52.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never pray for anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NThat's too bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should use your resources.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have to see you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can follow that\Nextendable sword of yours
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.65,0:18:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and know exactly where you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NHmph. Well, the moment\Nyou find me, you die!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.83,0:18:09.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One life holds 36\Nworldly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:12.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NTwo lives hold 72.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.71,0:18:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three lives hold\N108 worldly desires.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.63,0:18:23.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three swords...\N108 Caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.14,0:18:29.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1316,0,1,\c&HEAE5D4&\3c&HEAE5D4&\4c&HEAE5D4&)}[OHM]\NHe broke\Nthrough the iron clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\N...huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean this dog\Nobeys anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[barks]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:06.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:07.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that case, just knock\Nyourself unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just it, they're not bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.43,0:19:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NShandora. The City of Gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if the golden bell\Nsaid to be in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the city isn't here,\Nwhere is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.02,0:19:28.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The belfry was probably\Nengraved with poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIf that's the case,\Nthen the city probably fell
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in order to protect them.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.21,0:19:40.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NEven after all this time,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.41,0:19:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the belfry and the poneglyphs\Nshould still be here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.66,0:19:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're hidden somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.41,0:19:50.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A rail used to run\Nthrough this city.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NBut this is new.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.06,0:20:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something was moved out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.31,0:20:04.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]\NIsn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.73,0:20:12.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after being shot up into\Nthe sky, the city of Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,still majestically\Nexists in this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.60,0:20:20.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]\NEven if it's a\Ncity that everyone knows about,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.06,0:20:21.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,how can it show off\Nits lovely figure
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if it's covered by clouds?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI'm the only one\Nwho could see it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.89,0:20:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I discovered it. The former\NGods never even noticed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.21,0:20:35.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:37.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm God.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NYou're quite intelligent.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One might guess that you're an\Narcheologist from the Blue Sea
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.53,0:20:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,world by how fast you\Nfound this city of ruins.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.65,0:20:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It took us several months\Nto find the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.78,0:20:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's easier if\Nyou can read the letters
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.99,0:20:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on the ruins, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.12,0:21:03.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the gold you're\Nlooking for isn't here anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.45,0:21:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're a few\Nyears too late for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.07,0:21:07.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:09.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you're right about that.\NI couldn't find any.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must've been\Nthe one who removed it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NGold is a wonderful\Nthing to have and
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.70,0:21:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that glittering metal suits\Nme well, don't you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.00,0:21:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThen you must also\Nhave taken the golden bell
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.22,0:21:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that was once here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.31,0:21:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NHm? There was a golden bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:26.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN gasps]\NHe doesn't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.57,0:21:37.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well I'm very intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:41.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you learn by reading\Nthose letters on the bell?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NActually, it's too bad,\NI never got to read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:49.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you say it wasn't here when\Nyou arrived, it must not exist.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.34,0:21:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess the huge golden\Nbell and belfry that were
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the pride of Shandora must have\Nonly been another legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.05,0:21:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that I'll never be\Nable to lay my eyes on them.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's... It's actually\Nright here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.75,0:22:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's here in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.79,0:22:08.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When this island was blown\Ninto the sky 400 years ago
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.09,0:22:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the Upper Yard was born...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.93,0:22:13.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or, when "Godland" was born,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it was said that the\Nloud chimes of a bell
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.47,0:22:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,could be heard ringing\Nthroughout the entire nation.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.25,0:22:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThe elder\Ninhabitants of this land
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.08,0:22:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,called it the island's\Nsinging voice.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.67,0:22:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't it.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.25,0:22:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was the bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.71,0:22:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bell made of gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.80,0:22:32.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon the entire game\Nwill be over.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.89,0:22:36.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only eight minutes left.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.85,0:22:38.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not long at all. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:42.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it gives me plenty of time\Nto look for the golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.52,0:22:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.98,0:22:49.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NSo the golden\Nbell is in the sky?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means the\Nponeglyphs are, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.49,0:22:54.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.16,0:23:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sounds like there's\Na maggot on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SUU]\NSuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suu! Suu! Suu!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.06,0:23:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NWhat's the matter with you, Suu?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.52,0:23:15.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did we forget to feed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:17.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Suu, are you in pain?\NOr did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SUU chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.20,0:23:26.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NAre... Are you...?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.62,0:23:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NYes, I'm one of the men
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.69,0:23:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who used to serve Gan Fall\Nwhen he was God.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.51,0:23:33.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NSo you're one of\Nthe Divine Warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A groans]\NWe were in a\Nclosed off area, and then...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.23,0:23:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NGoodness, what on\Nearth happened to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.52,0:23:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis, he needs\Nyour help right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.57,0:23:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NNo wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.15,0:23:50.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My family's on Angel Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.28,0:23:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... Please help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.15,0:23:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NI will.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.41,0:23:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know everyone's worried\Nabout all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.24,0:24:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let everyone know Eneru... he's\Nplanning to return everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:02.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.10,0:24:04.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NSkypiea will be dropped\Nback into the Blue Sea world,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.25,0:24:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and this entire nation\Nwill no longer exist!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.40,0:24:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that... can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.33,0:24:16.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.\NYou must tell everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.20,0:24:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do it, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.21,0:24:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NOur lives will soon be over.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.92,0:24:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru is planning to eliminate\Nevery living person
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.34,0:24:25.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.89,0:24:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eliminate everyone from the sky?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.10,0:24:33.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But wait... If he succeeds\Nin that then...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.34,0:24:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...he won't have\Na place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:37.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.\NWhy would he want to do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.86,0:24:39.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He built a ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.75,0:24:41.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Ark Maxim.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.09,0:24:44.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PAGAYA]\NArk Maxim...?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.54,0:24:47.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(731,0,1,\c&HE9EAEA&\3c&HE9EAEA&\4c&HE9EAEA&)}Hey, what are y...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.74,0:24:57.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were forced to spend
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the last six years of our lives\Nbuilding that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CONIS yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:02.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:10.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.66,0:25:12.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE9EBEB&\3c&HE9EBEB&\4c&HE9EBEB&\t(-500,458,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}When the sky finally\Nbecomes peaceful,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.87,0:25:15.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE9EBEB&\3c&HE9EBEB&\4c&HE9EBEB&\t(-500,458,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I'd like to be able to show\Neveryone the hospitality
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.00,0:25:18.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3611,0,1,\c&HE9EAEB&\3c&HE9EAEB&\4c&HE9EAEB&)}they once knew to\Nmy heart's content.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.75,0:25:20.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3611,0,1,\c&HE9EAEB&\3c&HE9EAEB&\4c&HE9EAEB&)}Including you.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.43,0:25:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat exactly\Ndid you just do?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.19,0:25:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I showed mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.16,0:25:47.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThis man, he has Logia Power!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.54,0:25:50.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now, I must say that what\Nlittle time we have left here
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.62,0:25:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is coming to a close.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.25,0:25:54.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning\Nof the end.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.34,0:25:56.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will now set into motion\Na series of events
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.92,0:25:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that will reveal\Nmy ultimate plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What plan? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.79,0:26:06.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThe Sky Lord is calling to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.96,0:26:11.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heed my call, lowly\Nbeings, and come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.17,0:26:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:17.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ENERU]\NSango!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.27,0:26:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.62,0:26:38.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.29,0:26:41.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.08,0:26:42.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NIt was I who brought you
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.96,0:26:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and your friends\Nhere to Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.50,0:26:47.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I beckoned you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.25,0:26:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI've never seen\Nanything like this before.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.71,0:26:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This man possesses\Nsuch tremendous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.89,0:27:02.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole place\Nis falling apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NIt's Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.34,0:27:08.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the only one\Nwho's powerful enough
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.05,0:27:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to do something like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.55,0:27:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I better think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.07,0:27:18.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NChopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.35,0:27:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yelling, gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.44,0:27:25.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.23,0:27:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.65,0:27:34.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that...?\NThere's a hole at the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:44.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.67,0:27:48.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now this brings us\Nto our climactic finale.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.62,0:27:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NI suggest we\Nattempt our escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.92,0:27:55.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right. Yeah.\NIt's now or never.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.46,0:27:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy get over here and\Ngrab hold of the waver.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.67,0:27:59.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finally get\Nus out of this snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right. Hey, you, hang on to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.37,0:28:03.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[engine revs]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.77,0:28:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yay. Can't wait to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.48,0:28:09.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[AISA, LUFFY yelp]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.77,0:28:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NMan overboard!\NWe can't leave them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.65,0:28:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre, go back! You have\Nto save those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:19.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIERRE squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.32,0:28:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:23.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.87,0:28:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.25,0:28:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd we get so high up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:32.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NI have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre! Don't worry about me!\NYou have to save the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.43,0:28:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.94,0:28:43.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NSo what are we gonna\Ndo now that the bird's gone,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.47,0:28:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you weird old man?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.72,0:28:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NMy name's Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.93,0:28:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.60,0:28:51.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI don't care! Just save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.27,0:28:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]
